+## Find a task in the Nixflex app
+
+| Task | Where to go in the app |
+| --- | --- |
+| Check recent calls or messages | Open **Home** for activity or **Inbox** for conversations. |
+| Open an agent or business number | Tap **Agents**, then choose **Agents** or **Numbers**. Open the item you want to inspect. |
+| Make a call or review campaigns | Open **Outbound**. Available actions depend on your role. |
+| Contact support | Choose **Account → Help → Copy email address**, then write to **support@nixflex.com** from your email app. The contact sheet also links to Docs and System status. |

 ## Before you start

